# PART 3 — BACKEND ARCHITECTURE, SOCKET.IO, SEQUELIZE & REAL-TIME PROCESSING

---

# 1. BACKEND OBJECTIVE

The backend is the central intelligence layer.

Responsibilities:

```text
Authentication

Authorization

Data Storage

Data Processing

Geospatial Queries

WebSocket Broadcasting

Analytics Aggregation

File Uploads

System Configuration
```

The backend must be generic enough to support:

* SOC
* Fleet Tracking
* IoT
* Smart Cities
* Fraud Monitoring
* Emergency Systems

without architectural changes.

